01:36.320 --> 01:37.860
My name is Asami.

01:37.860 --> 01:39.910
I'm a 17-year-old high school girl.

01:40.490 --> 01:44.040
I keep it secret from everyone, but...

01:44.040 --> 01:45.750
I'm actually married.

01:46.250 --> 01:50.130
My husband, Ichimaru Kyousuke-sensei,
teaches at my school.

01:56.170 --> 01:57.630
Are you hot?

01:58.300 --> 01:59.590
No, I'm fine.

02:04.890 --> 02:06.810
Summer break starts today.

02:08.020 --> 02:11.360
I can be with my husband
all day, every day.

02:12.770 --> 02:14.440
Asami-onee~chan!

02:16.530 --> 02:17.780
Sasuke-kun!?

02:17.780 --> 02:19.360
Let's play!

02:21.530 --> 02:26.500
Vacation for Two ♥

02:27.370 --> 02:28.250
Take that!

02:29.000 --> 02:30.330
And that!

02:30.670 --> 02:32.920
Isn't this fun, Asami-oneechan?

02:32.920 --> 02:34.050
Yeah, sure.

02:34.380 --> 02:36.840
It may be summer break,

02:37.380 --> 02:39.880
but we still can't catch a break here.

02:39.880 --> 02:42.100
Asami-oneechan,

02:42.100 --> 02:44.310
there's more where that came from!

02:44.810 --> 02:46.100
Pew pew pew!

02:47.270 --> 02:48.480
Skeet skeet!

02:48.890 --> 02:51.480
Summer hot springs trips for couples.

02:51.810 --> 02:52.940
This is it.

02:57.650 --> 03:01.320
Asami-oneechan,
I can see through your clothes.

03:11.920 --> 03:12.920
Hello...

03:21.840 --> 03:24.050
Asami... Asami!

03:26.180 --> 03:27.470
Darling?

03:32.600 --> 03:35.060
Asami, let's go on a trip tomorrow.

03:35.060 --> 03:35.770
Huh?

03:35.770 --> 03:39.650
I booked some lodging by the ocean,
so we'll be able to swim.

03:39.650 --> 03:42.990
We can take it easy in a place
where no one will get in the way.

03:42.990 --> 03:44.370
Just the two of us.

03:45.450 --> 03:46.530
Sure!

03:54.580 --> 03:57.170
Thank goodness for the fine weather.

03:57.170 --> 03:59.920
Yeah, it's a perfect day for a trip.

03:59.920 --> 04:02.930
I'm going to go get something to drink.

04:02.930 --> 04:05.340
I'll go get the tickets.

04:05.970 --> 04:09.430
Let's see, we transfer at the second stop...

04:10.310 --> 04:12.810
Ahh, that was fast, Asa...mi?

04:12.810 --> 04:13.850
"Asami"?

04:13.850 --> 04:17.270
Uhh, no, I was talking about the morning.

04:14.150 --> 04:19.860
TL Note: "Asa" = morning,
although Asami's name uses a different kanji.

04:17.270 --> 04:19.860
Isn't this a beautiful morning,
Iwasaki-sensei?

04:20.190 --> 04:22.150
Yes, it is a fine morning.

04:22.150 --> 04:24.360
Good morning to you, Ichimaru-sensei.

04:24.700 --> 04:26.740
G-Good morning.

04:26.740 --> 04:28.410
Are you on a trip?

04:28.410 --> 04:31.330
Um... Yeah. Are you on one, too?

04:31.330 --> 04:32.290
Yes!

04:32.290 --> 04:34.370
Darling, sorry to keep you...

04:37.290 --> 04:41.510
Did you hear something just now?
I could swear I heard "Darling"...

04:40.800 --> 04:42.760
I-It's your imagination.

04:42.760 --> 04:46.180
Ahh, the train's about to arrive. Let's hurry.

04:47.180 --> 04:49.220
Why is Iwasaki-sensei here?

04:58.060 --> 05:00.610
Umm, Iwasaki-sensei.

05:00.610 --> 05:04.150
We're fellow travelers on this journey.
Isn't that right?

05:05.740 --> 05:08.320
Ichimaru-sensei, if you'd like,

05:08.320 --> 05:10.700
you can keep me company...

05:14.540 --> 05:16.040
...and go <i>very</i> far with me.

05:16.040 --> 05:18.500
Um, yeah, about that...

05:22.630 --> 05:24.260
I'm just kidding.

05:25.340 --> 05:29.760
Shimoura Station. Passengers transferring to the Ogasawara line, please do so here.

05:30.220 --> 05:32.470
This is my stop.

05:34.100 --> 05:37.440
Actually, I was kidding on the square...

05:37.440 --> 05:38.650
Pardon?

05:38.650 --> 05:41.230
Nothing. See you at school.

05:54.750 --> 05:56.960
It seems like you've enjoyed yourself.

05:56.960 --> 05:59.130
I-I have not!

06:08.760 --> 06:11.890
I haven't swum in the ocean
for a long time.

06:11.890 --> 06:13.560
Darling?

06:20.980 --> 06:22.230
How does it look?

06:22.230 --> 06:24.780
Very good! It's perfect for you, Asami.

06:25.990 --> 06:27.450
Darling...

06:32.660 --> 06:34.290
Take that!

06:37.040 --> 06:38.080
Wait up!

06:55.470 --> 06:57.680
You're heavy, Asami.

06:59.980 --> 07:01.560
Darling.

07:06.900 --> 07:08.320
Asami...

07:13.120 --> 07:14.830
Please don't speak.

07:15.410 --> 07:18.830
We made it all the way to the beach,
and not a hunk in sight.

07:19.160 --> 07:22.750
Satomi, is that the only reason
we came here?

07:22.750 --> 07:25.210
What are you saying? Of course it is.

07:25.210 --> 07:28.840
Why did Satomi and Kasumi have to come <i>here?</i>

07:28.840 --> 07:32.260
The blue sea, the piercing sun,
and this nice body.

07:32.260 --> 07:34.850
All we're missing are some cute guys.

07:35.600 --> 07:37.600
Kasumi, let's go!

07:37.600 --> 07:39.350
'Kay.

07:39.810 --> 07:41.060
Something wrong?

07:41.060 --> 07:43.100
No, it's nothing.

07:49.570 --> 07:50.570
Darling!?

07:54.370 --> 07:56.950
I-I'm sorry, Darling.

08:17.180 --> 08:19.810
This<i> time, no one will bother us,</i>

08:19.810 --> 08:22.890
and we can be alone together. Right?

08:24.480 --> 08:26.440
Once we get out of the bath,

08:27.310 --> 08:28.900
my husband and I...

08:30.360 --> 08:32.900
Asami-onee~chaaaan!!!

08:36.240 --> 08:37.580
Sasuke-kun?!

08:37.580 --> 08:38.950
What a coincidence.

08:38.950 --> 08:40.370
U-Umm...

08:40.620 --> 08:44.920
We must be connected
by the red string of fate.

08:44.920 --> 08:46.580
Let's sleep together tonight!

08:46.580 --> 08:48.340
U-Umm...

08:50.000 --> 08:51.090
Asami?

08:51.760 --> 08:53.340
Sakura-san?

08:54.010 --> 08:57.850
Mama, Asami-oneechan is here.
We were destined to meet!

09:00.220 --> 09:02.100
This isn't destiny at all!

09:02.100 --> 09:05.810
So <i>this</i> is why you suddenly wanted to go on a trip.

09:09.730 --> 09:14.780
Bathing with Asami-oneechan in the hot springs,

09:14.780 --> 09:18.410
sleeping with her in the futon...

09:16.570 --> 09:18.410
You don't have to worry.

09:18.410 --> 09:19.450
Eh?

09:19.450 --> 09:21.450
Let me handle Sasuke.

09:22.040 --> 09:26.170
I won't let him get in the way,
so you and Sensei can relax in peace.

09:29.420 --> 09:31.170
Sakura-san...

09:44.020 --> 09:45.480
Darling?

09:47.230 --> 09:48.810
Asami.

09:48.810 --> 09:52.360
Mama, untie me!

09:52.360 --> 09:55.570
I can't go to
Asami-oneechan's room like this.

09:55.570 --> 09:57.570
It's bedtime for kids.

09:57.570 --> 10:00.870
No way! Asami-oneechan~!

10:01.330 --> 10:03.580
Yeah, whatever. Good night, sleep tight.

10:09.330 --> 10:11.840
Have him pamper you, Asami.

10:21.510 --> 10:23.560
Today certainly was eventful.

10:24.140 --> 10:25.560
It sure was.

10:35.480 --> 10:36.740
Darling.

10:43.950 --> 10:45.240
Asami!

10:46.540 --> 10:47.830
Darling...

10:55.500 --> 10:58.170
Eh? Asami, did you shrink?

10:58.170 --> 10:59.840
No; did you?

11:03.760 --> 11:05.100
Sasuke-kun!

11:05.430 --> 11:07.350
W-What're you doing here?

11:07.350 --> 11:08.850
Where's Sakura-san?

11:16.360 --> 11:20.110
Don't be a pest, Sasuke.

11:25.120 --> 11:28.200
Oh, well.
We'd better get some sleep too.

11:28.200 --> 11:29.500
Right.

11:31.000 --> 11:33.080
This trip didn't go as I'd hoped,

11:33.790 --> 11:38.130
but I was able to be with
my husband for the entire day.

11:39.170 --> 11:42.970
Next time, please love me lots, 'kay?

11:44.260 --> 11:47.640
Sweet dreams, Darling.

11:52.650 --> 11:54.400
My name is Asami.

11:54.400 --> 11:56.440
I'm a 17-year-old high school girl.

11:57.190 --> 12:00.900
I keep it secret from everyone, but...

12:00.900 --> 12:02.660
I'm actually married.

12:03.320 --> 12:07.490
My husband, Ichimaru Kyousuke-sensei,
teaches at my school.

12:08.660 --> 12:13.750
Today, he and I went to
the city's fireworks display.

12:14.670 --> 12:19.170
We both wore our yukatas,
in order to enhance the festive atmosphere.

12:20.300 --> 12:23.010
Have you been looking forward
to the fireworks?

12:23.010 --> 12:23.930
Yep.

12:24.840 --> 12:28.850
The fireworks will be nice,
but this feeling,

12:28.850 --> 12:31.640
and the chance to be
alone with my husband,

12:31.640 --> 12:34.520
is what makes me happiest.

12:42.780 --> 12:47.700
The Festival, Fireworks, And...

12:52.120 --> 12:54.920
Wow, what a crowd.

12:55.540 --> 12:56.920
It sure is.

12:57.170 --> 12:59.750
The fireworks display
is launching here, right?

13:00.300 --> 13:04.680
Hmm, maybe we'll be able
to see the fireworks from over there.

13:05.300 --> 13:08.640
Hopefully, there won't be too many people on the far side of the shrine.

13:08.640 --> 13:10.260
I think you're right.

13:10.930 --> 13:14.060
I'm so happy I get to watch
the fireworks with my husband...

13:14.850 --> 13:17.100
...together, alone.

13:23.070 --> 13:25.490
Ahh, Darling...!

13:26.910 --> 13:30.740
And while we're alone,
one thing should<i> lead to another...</i>

13:30.740 --> 13:32.040
What's the matter?

13:32.580 --> 13:35.910
No, nothing at all. Teeheehee.

13:38.880 --> 13:40.960
I guess I'm a little hungry.

13:41.300 --> 13:43.090
Shall we get something to eat?

13:43.090 --> 13:44.340
Sure.

13:44.340 --> 13:46.970
Let's see...

13:47.380 --> 13:48.680
Yakisoba!

13:54.180 --> 13:55.020
Excuse me...

13:55.560 --> 13:56.940
Yes?

13:57.480 --> 13:59.520
S-Satomi!

14:00.440 --> 14:04.570
W-What are <i>you</i> doing
in a place like this, Satomi?

14:04.570 --> 14:06.700
Working part-time.

14:05.780 --> 14:06.700
Not good.

14:07.320 --> 14:09.820
Asami, weren't you here with someone?

14:09.820 --> 14:11.450
Nope, I'm alone.

14:11.450 --> 14:14.540
Ahh, is that so?

14:14.540 --> 14:18.920
Say, if you have nothing else to do,
can you look after the stall for a bit?

14:18.920 --> 14:19.790
Huh?

14:19.790 --> 14:22.460
Actually, my boyfriend's
here at the festival, too.

14:22.460 --> 14:25.760
Eh? You already have a new boyfriend?

14:25.760 --> 14:29.840
Don't get hung up on the details.
C'mon, help a girl out here!

14:29.840 --> 14:31.390
A-All right.

14:31.390 --> 14:33.390
You'll be just fine.

14:33.390 --> 14:34.970
They're pre-made.

14:34.970 --> 14:36.060
Okay.

14:36.060 --> 14:39.980
Thanks a bunch. I'll be back soon, 'kay?

14:40.900 --> 14:42.020
Asami.

14:43.270 --> 14:46.190
We should keep our distance for now.

14:46.190 --> 14:49.910
Yes, we should.
Plus, she said she'd be back soon.

14:49.910 --> 14:51.740
Can I get some yakisoba?

14:52.490 --> 14:56.500
Umm... here you go.

14:56.500 --> 15:00.250
Let's meet behind the shrine at 8:00,
once the fireworks start.

15:00.250 --> 15:00.830
Okay.

15:01.540 --> 15:02.880
Come again!

15:08.590 --> 15:10.590
Well, if it isn't Ichimaru-sensei!

15:10.590 --> 15:13.010
Ack! Iwasaki-sensei-!

15:13.550 --> 15:17.220
What are you up to?
Enjoying the summer festival alone?

15:17.560 --> 15:20.480
Err, yeah.
Are you doing the same thing?

15:20.480 --> 15:23.730
Yes. But there are so many people,

15:24.190 --> 15:26.530
and I'm tired of looking at them.

15:29.240 --> 15:31.030
Sensei?

15:32.700 --> 15:36.490
Would you like to have
some tea together over there?

15:37.200 --> 15:38.500
B-But...

15:38.500 --> 15:41.830
Pretty please, with a cherry on top?

15:46.960 --> 15:50.670
Bulls-eye! Got a stuffed animal.

15:50.670 --> 15:52.720
Nice shooting.

15:59.350 --> 16:01.850
Our teachers...?

16:02.350 --> 16:04.860
Thank you very much.

16:05.270 --> 16:06.900
Three yakisobas, please.

16:06.900 --> 16:08.230
Okay.

16:09.360 --> 16:12.450
I'm sorry, but we only
have two cartons left.

16:12.450 --> 16:15.570
Ahh, too bad, so sad.

16:15.570 --> 16:16.580
Sorry.

16:17.030 --> 16:19.580
I'll just wait for more.

16:19.580 --> 16:20.410
Eh?

16:20.410 --> 16:23.830
You <i>can</i> cook yakisoba,
can't you? I'll wait.

16:25.790 --> 16:30.550
Ah... Yes, sir! That's right, yakisoba, so...

16:43.690 --> 16:47.230
Your order is ready.
Thank you for waiting.

16:47.650 --> 16:49.230
Three yakisobas, please.

16:49.650 --> 16:50.320
Sure thing.

16:50.320 --> 16:54.320
Sorry, sorry. That took
longer than I thought.

16:54.320 --> 16:56.240
And you've even made some yakisoba.

16:56.240 --> 16:58.490
Aw, it was nothing.

16:58.910 --> 17:02.960
I'll thank you with some yakisoba that you made.

17:02.960 --> 17:05.870
Gee, thanks. See you.

17:05.870 --> 17:08.420
Oh yeah, that reminds me...

17:09.000 --> 17:11.630
Ichimaru-sensei was here a moment ago.

17:12.210 --> 17:15.930
He left with Iwasaki-sensei, though.

17:15.930 --> 17:19.720
Two fellow teachers on a date, perhaps?

17:24.020 --> 17:28.400
And then, Sonoda-sensei was like,
"Shall we go to the beach?"

17:28.400 --> 17:32.400
But once I heard that,
some work happened to come up...

17:50.170 --> 17:52.420
Thank you very much.

17:53.050 --> 17:57.090
Sorry for going on and on
without letting you get a word in.

17:57.090 --> 17:58.680
I-It's fine.

17:59.640 --> 18:01.390
Umm, Sensei?

18:03.310 --> 18:07.600
Would you mind joining me for a drink somewhere?

18:07.600 --> 18:09.310
Umm, but...

18:09.310 --> 18:10.650
What's the harm?

18:13.530 --> 18:14.480
Please?

18:14.480 --> 18:17.400
H-Hmm, let me see...

18:26.660 --> 18:27.500
Fireworks?

18:31.960 --> 18:33.460
Iwasaki-sensei,

18:33.960 --> 18:37.510
I have important matters to attend to.
Please excuse me.

19:26.390 --> 19:28.390
Asami.

19:28.930 --> 19:30.190
Darling.

19:30.190 --> 19:33.060
Sorry I'm late.

19:33.060 --> 19:35.690
Don't be; it's fine.

19:39.990 --> 19:41.070
It's beautiful.

19:41.070 --> 19:44.160
It's like we've got front-row seats.

19:45.330 --> 19:49.120
I'm glad I was able to see this
with my husband.

19:53.830 --> 19:56.340
That reminds me:
I never got anything to eat.

19:56.960 --> 19:59.420
Here, take this.

19:59.420 --> 20:02.300
You bought some yakisoba for me.

20:02.300 --> 20:05.800
No, I made that.

20:05.800 --> 20:09.140
Eh? All the more reason to eat it!

20:12.690 --> 20:14.520
Delicious!

20:14.520 --> 20:15.690
Thank goodness.

20:16.650 --> 20:21.740
I'm so happy. Darling,
can we stay like this...

20:57.060 --> 21:01.610
His breath.
The fragrance of the yakisoba...

21:02.280 --> 21:03.950
What are you two doing?

21:11.410 --> 21:14.370
You mustn't misuse food in this manner!

21:14.370 --> 21:17.130
T-Th-That voice is... Father!?

21:17.130 --> 21:18.750
T-Th-That voice is... Father!?

21:19.540 --> 21:23.550
You're mistaken.
I-I'm just a random passerby.

21:24.130 --> 21:27.930
At any rate,
I will not permit improper conduct!

21:28.890 --> 21:30.930
It's not allowed because I say so.

21:31.600 --> 21:34.940
Geez, why did it turn out like this?

21:35.640 --> 21:37.730
But...

21:40.320 --> 21:42.730
...I'm glad we were able
to watch them together.

21:49.570 --> 21:51.160
Darling...

21:52.200 --> 21:57.250
Let's come back here next year,
and in the years after that.

22:16.140 --> 22:19.650
All I am is a kitten

22:16.140 --> 22:19.650
watashi wa koneko

22:19.650 --> 22:23.570
All for you, and yours alone

22:19.650 --> 22:23.570
anata hitori dake no

22:23.570 --> 22:30.450
A naive little kitten; I want you to raise me right.

22:23.570 --> 22:30.450
mijuku na koneko sodatete hoshii no

22:30.990 --> 22:34.490
Can't you grant me this simple wish for anything

22:30.990 --> 22:34.490
nozomareru koto no subete ni

22:34.490 --> 22:38.670
and every last thing that I desire?

22:34.490 --> 22:38.670
kotaete yukeru kana

22:38.670 --> 22:42.090
If you stare at me with those longing, hungry eyes,

22:38.670 --> 22:42.090
nagai me de mitete kuretara

22:42.090 --> 22:48.010
I'll make this scene hotter and hotter just for you

22:42.090 --> 22:48.010
dokidoki sasete itte ageru

